 "description": "<p>Nine vibrator modes and nine tongue-licking modes run independently on this medical-grade build, and the independence matters: the tongue can hold its slowest lap while the vibration climbs, or the vibration can sit low while the tongue speeds past it. Fixed-pairing toys cannot do either trick.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_4_7a36c4e6-d5ae-420c-b1f6-66f8bcd80095_480x480.jpg?v=1691830939\"></p>\n<p>The full charge takes about an hour and returns roughly the same in runtime — a same-day cycle that fits an evening charge and an evening use. USB handles power; no dock required.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_3_cc71c3dc-486c-43a6-a381-6520383ccae8_480x480.jpg?v=1691830936\"></p>\n<p>IPX7 waterproofing covers full submersion, so the bath question answers itself, and the 55 dB ceiling keeps the motor inside apartment-friendly bounds even on the combined top settings.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_5_8797ffda-d5af-44ef-a3f3-dfe998adfa13_480x480.jpg?v=1691830943\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 9</li>\n<li>Tongue-licking modes: 9</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone + ABS</li>\n<li>Battery: USB, about 1 h charge / 1 h play</li>\n<li>Noise: under 55 dB</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_7_21eb6a62-7eba-4378-a1e8-6183d027ed61_480x480.jpg?v=1691830950\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_1_a83a6878-0700-4f2d-8647-17dc776dac8d_480x480.jpg?v=1691830933\"></p>\n<p>Both channels can also simply run their default pairing for users who want zero setup, which is how most sessions start anyway. Two independent nines — for users who want to set each hand separately.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose tongue vibrator with independent 9 vibration and 9 licking modes, medical silicone, 1-hour USB charge and IPX7 submersion body.</p>\n",
